    "title": "Centralia City Schools prepare to start new school year - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Austin Williams ,\n9 hours ago The Centralia City Schools Board of Education approved an addendum to a lease contract with BCMW for the former Field School. The addendum adds the physical address of the building and corrects a date. There will be a budget hearing before the next regular school board meeting on September 8. Read full article",
